docs {
  `POST /api/v2/onlineorder/additemstolatest`

  Get the shopper's most recent incomplete shopping cart (creating one if needed) and add the supplied products to it.

  Required scope: `api/Write`

  Optional query parameters are disabled; enable the ones you need on the **Params** tab.
}
